{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_intro_title", "source_sha256": "868310e193d1af0b9a0a16b18d5826a5490fe3f9410defa30dc115829fc1db4a", "ja": "なし", "zh": "无", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_intro_synopsis", "source_sha256": "868310e193d1af0b9a0a16b18d5826a5490fe3f9410defa30dc115829fc1db4a", "ja": "なし", "zh": "无", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "57d586bbb0e50a83335f26eb5e4b39d493afea9e2688cf13f8e691b48a93c032", "ja": "{$P$}さんのスーツも、\n私がお洗濯した方が……でも、おせっかいかなぁ……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生的西装，\n我也顺便洗一洗好了……这样会太鸡婆吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "598f28d1a708b2ab3dddbc729ca0df80a4f9291bb100da0d095897a040b4e3e2", "ja": "青羽さん？　俺のスーツがどうかしましたか？", "zh": "青羽小姐？我的西装怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "e3db6e39c97eb0d8fab48ac988e869630473c0afb73935ebec76cdc904060b64", "ja": "ひゃあっ！？　{$P$}さん！\nい、いえ、こっちの話です……コホンッ！", "zh": "呀啊！？{$P$}先生！\n没、没事，我在自言自语……咳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "c940c55f09723d30e21136e925ca9fc414f1092f0fee92e22504fab4c4ba06fa", "ja": "それより、{$P$}さん！　社長さんが\n呼んでいましたよ。大切なお話があるそうです。", "zh": "是说，{$P$}先生！\n社长在找你喔，他好像有重要的事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "52ed1b9adbaf3af28caa1f18603bf80778b87dad32a667076bf135801ecb7db8", "ja": "え、本当ですか？　それは楽しみですね。\nじゃあ、早速行ってきます！", "zh": "咦？真的吗？这还真让人期待。\n那我马上去找他！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "1424b8dfcbda74b264231e8b22ab00f82ceacf55623ac09da7efe87572da5ff7", "ja": "はい、いってらっしゃ～い♪", "zh": "好的，请慢走～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_intro_1006_null", "source_sha256": "a643276fac463f5e06ddf29dab1f31b8e2c7f7bb284470f7983baf09f788ee39", "ja": "そして……。", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_intro_1007_101kot", "source_sha256": "4c90426b509119bc5cee0f5cb60aa3c5ef894cfd13371752288b527b794c744f", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん。\nお待ちしていましたよ♪", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生。\n等你好久了唷♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "16e2967ba9f9a89037d0dce3e3882101b8597dc8b68b3693c0ff12a29902c88e", "ja": "お疲れさまです。話があると聞いて来たんですが、\nひょっとして……？", "zh": "辛苦了。我听说社长有事要找我，\n难不成是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_intro_1009_president", "source_sha256": "835f91694fa8f9e3bbb2f9b0df6c951afc60adfbb11b486d209f164727b74dc6", "ja": "相変わらず、察しがいいようだね。\n本題に入る前に、先日のAngel公演についてだが……", "zh": "你还是这么敏锐呢。\n在进入正题以前，关于Angel前些日子的公演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_intro_1010_president", "source_sha256": "943f06a651917ba546a3f6af2156eefc1e429744487fcc6660c661417465006f", "ja": "いやあ、本当に素晴らしかった！　間違いなく、\n我が765プロの歴史に刻むべき公演だったよ。", "zh": "哎呀，真是太精彩啦！那毫无疑问\n是该写进我们765艺能历史当中的公演啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_intro_1011_101kot", "source_sha256": "016d531336275ba1c7aebe1e0e6ffabb194ea04906b55e0c5122ea251b44c738", "ja": "とっても幸せな気分になれる公演でしたね～。\n思わずDVD3枚予約しちゃいました♪", "zh": "是一场让观众心中幸福洋溢的公演呢～\n我一不小心就预购了三张DVD♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "85977b0831b4cfa96c906f451b3d4219d93a627fee78e9688e9797ee7c41c87e", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　これもみんなの頑張りと、\n素晴らしいファンに恵まれたおかげです。", "zh": "谢谢你们的夸奖！这全是多亏有大家的努力，\n还有热情的粉丝支持。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_intro_1013_president", "source_sha256": "6b66a604eff1c027ba56e35a97bc0dbc20ac723f38398de03ff33ff97f98a017", "ja": "うむ！　というわけで、ここでいよいよ、\nPrincessチームのお披露目といこうじゃないか！", "zh": "很好！所以说呢，\n该是时候让Princess队登台亮相了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_intro_1014_p", "source_sha256": "3398107df5aac6a932cfc651f5a966a21fa03a5e1ea6d7a0441ec433f7cc4100", "ja": "おお、ついに！", "zh": "哦哦，终于！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_intro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "c6cc9d23926fa3a0d3d31ff8cc04a17ae8b747dd2f3d8d33fe4aeea79b1d723b", "ja": "お披露目公演のオープニングナンバーを歌う\n『PRINCESS STARS』のメンバーは……", "zh": "被选为『PRINCESS STARS』的成员，\n要演唱首次亮相公演的开场曲目的人是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "368afb5579a064ae2da739d9e86f749c19069d0b9db49bf7063086cb35deb82d", "ja": "春日未来君、矢吹可奈君、徳川まつり君、\nエミリー君、七尾百合子君の5人だ！", "zh": "春日未来、矢吹可奈、德川茉莉、\n艾蜜莉、七尾百合子，以上这五人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "2dc8598f2d8e5620d206e57af60f8bc001ece355ded2ac60c88e2b89e302b313", "ja": "プロデュースは引き続き、君に任せたい。\nやってくれるね？", "zh": "培育的任务我一样想交给你，\n你不会拒绝吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_intro_1018", "source_sha256": "9c3e0eab7135bbf0124c363d162784a0708abfe045d94917138ffb36a58b21a3", "ja": "もちろんです！", "zh": "这是当然的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "0b70aeba7763297296bccaf03e0681a9c8f23de519ea43be88cfb7c7df9c9d44", "ja": "もちろん、やらせてください。\nいい公演になるよう、精一杯プロデュースします！", "zh": "这是当然的，请交给我吧。\n为了成就一场好公演，我会努力培育她们的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_intro_2001_president", "source_sha256": "81a1ad2990a0f527cfc95af8bd17fe0773b5ada4a7808aeb8e9799332235d1fc", "ja": "うむ！　彼女達の本当の輝きを引き出せるのは\n君しかいない。期待しているよ！", "zh": "很好！只有你能激发出她们真正的光芒，\n我很看好你喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_intro_2002_101kot", "source_sha256": "353fb9f86a37cd376d69b5bb8dc264cf3a4ca568a735243a57d2b21348a76294", "ja": "お姫さまといえば、女の子の永遠の憧れ……。\nふふっ、しっかりエスコートしてあげてくださいね♪", "zh": "提到公主，那可是女孩子永远的憧憬……\n呵呵，你这个护花使者要好好加油喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_intro_2003_p", "source_sha256": "14b656bd8411d86a29c60da18e6e159bcec7312970bd9bb7a55c94b4d8f14efa", "ja": "（Princessのみんなも、\nこの時を待ち望んでいたに違いない）", "zh": "（各位Princess\n肯定也等这一刻等很久了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0017_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_intro_2004_p", "source_sha256": "98e5527c141ae6283c1249b6580ed3cc3fe89a8b4cec4d41b9f7350406401294", "ja": "（誰もが幼い頃の淡い夢を思い出せるような……。\nそんな公演になるよう、俺も頑張ろう！）", "zh": "（一场任谁看了都会想起儿时淡淡美梦的表演……\n为了打造这样的公演，我也要加油！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
